PTX MP+mmio+fences+global+diff-cluster
"Message passing in global memory, the threads in two clusters, an .mmio flag with fence.acq_rel.sys"
{
x=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0        | P1@cta 1,cluster 1,gpu 0         ;
 st.weak.global x, 1             | ld.mmio.relaxed.sys.global r0, f ;
 fence.acq_rel.sys               | fence.acq_rel.sys                ;
 st.mmio.relaxed.sys.global f, 1 | ld.weak.global r1, x             ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
